        <mxCell id="raRQFdQsiKbz0KAO8EUM-60" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;EF_folder&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;YEARMOD&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;veicCATEGORY&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;ConsumoGASOLINA&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;ConsumoETANOL&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;TiposdeCombustivel&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;ValoresSUC&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;DeterLevesOtto&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=43;align=center;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-828.75" y="6330" width="160" height="170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="NN52Et9S-NWGV-sPvVk5-1" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#ff3333&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;ProbCOMB_ComLEVES.m&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Esta função faz a probabilidade entre os&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;anos modelos, considerando&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;os grupos de combustível &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;para a categoria dos veículos &lt;b&gt;Comerciais Leves&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Exemplo:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Entre os anos de 1983 e 2002 só haviam veículos a álcool e gasolina (não existia veículos flex), logo, deve-se considerar veículos apenas desses dois tipo de combustível. A divisão entre a quantidade de veículos de cada tipo de combustível pela soma dos dois tipo de combustível é a probabilidade.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;A mesma coisa acontece entre os anos de 2003 e 2005, onde existem fatores de emissão para veículos à Gasolina, Etanol, Flex Gasolina e Flex Etanol.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;No ano de 2006 há fatores de emissão&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;para veículos à Gasolina, Etanol, Flex Gasolina, Flex Etanol e Diesel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;A partir de 2007 não há veículos somente a Etanol. Então a nova proporção da probabilidade é considerando veículos que consomem Gasolina, Flex Gasolina, Flex Etanol e Diesel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;OUTPUT:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;FUELTYPE_ComLEVES83&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;FUELTYPE_ComLEVES2003&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;FUELTYPE_ComLEVES2006&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc00cc&quot;&gt;FUELTYPE_ComLEVES2007&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#FF3333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-110" y="5690" width="717.19" height="540" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
